                        "gut (instinct)", "oracle (prediction)", "code (building)"],
            "how": "Each data point gets a tissue reaction — a one-line sub-comment",
        },
        "media_patterns": {
            "color": "#fa8",
            "layer": "TROPOSPHERE (weather system)",
            "sources": [
                "TV Tropes (narrative archetypes → pattern matching)",
                "Film (Kubrick → precision of framing = precision of data)",
